WEBVTT

00:01.980 --> 00:11.820
While watching anime, make sure not to sit too close to the screen and that the room is well lit.

00:05.040 --> 00:09.160
The Miare Stadium was attacked by giant plants that suddenly sprouted.

00:10.020 --> 00:16.760
This was done by Fleur-de-lis' Flare Gang, which had gained control of Zygarde.

00:18.440 --> 00:22.560
Citron, Serena and Eureka made their way towards the Prism Tower,

00:22.970 --> 00:26.070
but Satoshi got taken away together with Alan.

00:27.870 --> 00:37.190
And while Miare City was facing the danger of destruction, Squishy turned into a Zygarde and confronted its manipulated friend.

00:51.530 --> 00:52.260
Squishy is...

00:53.420 --> 00:53.980
...Zygarde?

00:59.860 --> 01:02.550
As the Pokémon who keeps on observing the world,

01:04.080 --> 01:07.950
its role is to deliver judgment upon those who disturb its order.

01:09.360 --> 01:12.720
This is the rage of Zygarde and the Flare Gang.

01:13.410 --> 01:15.340
It will bring this world back to zero.

01:16.930 --> 01:20.310
Before long, <i>that</i> Zygarde will also understand our mindset...

01:21.170 --> 01:23.520
...and turn red with rage.

01:23.880 --> 01:24.850
What rage?!

01:25.610 --> 01:27.390
There's no way Squishy feels that way!

01:29.720 --> 01:30.540
Alan!

01:31.290 --> 01:32.470
What is the meaning of this?!

01:33.000 --> 01:34.100
Please say something!

01:37.050 --> 01:37.750
Please look at this.

01:38.270 --> 01:42.010
In the middle of the plants covering Miare, there are two huge Pokémon.

01:42.850 --> 01:45.690
It is believed that they are the legendary Pokémon Zygarde.

01:57.980 --> 01:58.760
Squishy!

01:59.430 --> 02:00.960
Keep your eyes here!

02:01.420 --> 02:02.050
Crimgan,

02:02.390 --> 02:03.320
Dark Pulse!

02:12.480 --> 02:13.550
That was a close call.

02:14.070 --> 02:15.060
Professor Platane!

02:15.410 --> 02:15.690
Manon!

02:16.310 --> 02:16.760
Huh?

02:17.250 --> 02:17.870
That girl...

02:18.420 --> 02:19.200
Momiji didn't...

02:19.710 --> 02:20.200
Professor...

02:20.690 --> 02:21.030
What's that?

02:22.490 --> 02:23.160
Zygarde.

02:27.980 --> 02:30.250
Will you wake up already?

02:36.330 --> 02:42.000
The Shocking Zygarde VS Zygarde!
The Breaking World!!

02:43.030 --> 02:52.930
Play a board game via the Pocket Monsters XY& data broadcast!
Press the d-button on your remote and try reaching the battles and the presents!!

02:43.030 --> 02:52.930
Z

02:50.410 --> 02:50.970
Squishy...

02:51.490 --> 02:52.060
Hang in there.

02:52.870 --> 02:54.810
Squishy's friend, please understand.

02:57.000 --> 02:58.510
With two Mega Evolutions against us...

02:58.870 --> 03:00.670
...we're at a bit of a disadvantage.

03:01.990 --> 03:02.610
Lepardas,

03:02.960 --> 03:03.760
Shadow Claw!

03:04.970 --> 03:06.740
Burshamo, Blaze Kick!

03:09.820 --> 03:12.000
Please come out, Horubee, Harimaron!

03:12.450 --> 03:13.480
Elezard!

03:16.130 --> 03:16.930
Here we go.

03:18.280 --> 03:19.930
Rentorar, Wild Charge!

03:20.660 --> 03:21.080
Dodge!

03:22.680 --> 03:24.510
Harimaron, Pin Missile!

03:24.510 --> 03:26.050
Elezard, Dragon Tail!

03:32.560 --> 03:34.340
Lepardas, Dark Pulse!

03:35.520 --> 03:36.550
Mud Shot!

03:39.600 --> 03:41.360
Burshamo, Flamethrower!

03:42.760 --> 03:44.830
Crimgan, dodge and use Dragon Claw!

03:50.620 --> 03:51.200
Serena...

03:51.750 --> 03:53.240
Have Alan and Satoshi come here?

03:53.780 --> 03:55.770
They said they would be heading to the Prism Tower, but...

03:56.570 --> 03:58.550
No, it doesn't look like they're here yet.

03:59.300 --> 04:00.410
Maybe something happened.

04:00.910 --> 04:02.840
There's no need to worry about Alan and Satoshi.

04:03.320 --> 04:04.500
After all, they're both strong.

04:07.400 --> 04:08.070
And...

04:08.500 --> 04:09.880
I'm also worried about Hari-san.

04:11.010 --> 04:13.840
Hari-san has been asleep for a long time...

04:15.060 --> 04:16.190
...and it won't wake up.

04:17.480 --> 04:19.310
Oh... I'm sorry, Manon-chan.

04:19.910 --> 04:21.390
No, it's fine!

04:22.160 --> 04:26.230
So right now, it's getting treatment at a place called the Fleur-de-lis Labs.

04:27.100 --> 04:29.350
Please tell us if there's something we can do.

04:30.070 --> 04:31.320
We'll help you with anything.

04:32.180 --> 04:34.560
I hope Hari-san gets better soon.

04:38.430 --> 04:38.820
Manon,

04:39.550 --> 04:41.260
Hari-san is at the Fleur-de-lis Labs, right?

04:42.160 --> 04:42.540
Yeah.

04:43.380 --> 04:44.000
Citron!

04:44.570 --> 04:46.060
Yes, please go.

04:46.570 --> 04:48.390
We can handle this by ourselves.

04:48.910 --> 04:49.380
Serena,

04:49.740 --> 04:51.260
please take care of Manon and Hari-san.

04:52.220 --> 04:52.830
Thank you!

04:53.540 --> 04:55.350
Let's go save Hari-san.

04:56.010 --> 04:56.280
Yeah!

04:57.620 --> 04:58.230
I'll go as well.

04:58.740 --> 05:00.470
I have a car back at the lab.

05:02.120 --> 05:03.560
I don't know what's going on, but...

05:03.990 --> 05:05.810
...will you stop ignoring us?

05:06.170 --> 05:07.850
Lepardas, Shadow Claw!

05:13.220 --> 05:13.990
Come on, hurry!

05:14.730 --> 05:15.930
Thank you, Citron.

05:15.930 --> 05:17.910
Burshamo Mask, we're counting on you.

05:18.260 --> 05:19.120
Leave it to me!

05:19.590 --> 05:22.000
Oh well, let's leave those guys to Correa and the others.

05:22.370 --> 05:23.270
You're right.

05:23.270 --> 05:25.540
We'll do <i>our</i> jobs.

05:26.090 --> 05:27.020
I told you.

05:27.500 --> 05:29.960
I <i>am</i> the Gym Leader of the Miare Gym!

05:32.430 --> 05:33.780
Aren't the Fleur-de-lis Labs...?

05:33.780 --> 05:35.910
That's the secret base of the glasses corps.

05:36.640 --> 05:39.260
That might be worth visiting.

05:43.410 --> 05:43.760
Alan,

05:44.490 --> 05:45.620
this is all thanks to you.

05:46.660 --> 05:48.550
We used the Mega Evolution energy...

05:49.180 --> 05:50.940
...to control Zygarde.

05:57.210 --> 06:03.000
The Mega Evolution energy you kept on collecting is proving very useful for the destruction of the world.

06:05.880 --> 06:06.830
Look.

06:07.520 --> 06:09.310
There will be no tomorrow for this world.

06:10.730 --> 06:13.280
Once the sun is up, it will have become a new world.

06:14.440 --> 06:17.120
Who knew the end of something could be so beautiful?

06:17.810 --> 06:20.200
This truly is the first step towards peace.

06:35.320 --> 06:35.940
Alan...

06:38.460 --> 06:38.890
Manon...

06:39.810 --> 06:40.470
Harimaron...

06:41.690 --> 06:43.550
What was I...

06:44.850 --> 06:46.870
What was I fighting for?!

06:48.400 --> 06:48.950
What...?

06:49.960 --> 06:50.740
What...?!

06:52.990 --> 06:55.570
Hari-san has been asleep for a long time...

06:57.250 --> 06:58.260
...and it won't wake up.

06:58.820 --> 06:59.490
I see.

07:00.650 --> 07:02.180
So that's why Alan...

07:02.760 --> 07:03.930
Helping Harimaron...

07:04.800 --> 07:06.180
....and helping Manon...

07:06.590 --> 07:08.200
That pure wish of yours...

07:09.620 --> 07:11.510
...is truly noble.

07:16.740 --> 07:17.530
Oh my,

07:17.760 --> 07:20.150
what are you doing in such a dangerous place?

07:20.600 --> 07:22.550
We have to go to the Fleur-de-lis Labs.

07:22.900 --> 07:24.280
My precious partner is there!

07:24.790 --> 07:25.850
What did you say?!

07:26.090 --> 07:27.220
That's terrible.

07:27.470 --> 07:28.580
Let's hurry!

07:28.850 --> 07:31.120
We're from the Miare TV station!

07:31.660 --> 07:32.920
You came at just the right time.

07:33.270 --> 07:35.730
If you guide us, we can take you there with the helicopter.

07:36.670 --> 07:37.870
That would be of great help.

07:37.870 --> 07:39.100
Thank you very much.

07:39.100 --> 07:40.130
Don't mention it.

07:40.740 --> 07:43.220
We must stick together in tough times.

07:49.670 --> 07:50.860
All right, time for take off!

07:51.500 --> 07:54.340
To the Flare Gang's secret base!

07:54.340 --> 07:55.890
Huh? What did you just say?

07:55.890 --> 07:56.450
Gulp!

07:57.080 --> 07:59.950
T-To the flaring friendship this encounter will lead to.

08:11.380 --> 08:12.130
Please!

08:12.480 --> 08:14.490
May Squishy's feelings reach it!

08:25.220 --> 08:25.910
Squishy!

08:27.800 --> 08:28.090
Yeah.

08:32.090 --> 08:32.700
Hurry!

08:33.520 --> 08:34.730
Thank you, Carne-san!

08:35.410 --> 08:35.950
Champion!

08:37.490 --> 08:39.440
Please let us help with something as well.

08:40.150 --> 08:40.990
You guys...

08:41.770 --> 08:43.280
We can't just stand around doing nothing.

08:43.820 --> 08:44.810
We want to do something.

08:45.190 --> 08:46.000
Please!

08:49.240 --> 08:52.460
In that case, I want to prioritize the rescue of children and the elderly.

08:53.050 --> 08:54.190
Can you gather them here for me?

08:55.150 --> 08:55.830
Gladly!

08:56.100 --> 08:57.100
Please leave it to us!

08:57.350 --> 08:57.990
All right!

08:58.420 --> 08:59.350
Understood!

09:06.100 --> 09:07.470
If we just take over...

09:07.990 --> 09:09.430
...their secret base...

09:10.120 --> 09:13.440
...the Rocket Gang's conquest of Kalos may come true.

09:40.370 --> 09:43.380
You'll become ours as well!

09:44.340 --> 09:44.930
Satoshi-kun,

09:46.040 --> 09:49.160
you'll allow me to make use of the bond phenomenon for my world.

09:51.520 --> 09:54.570
You obtained that strong power with just your bond, without even using a stone...

09:55.080 --> 09:57.190
When I saw it for the first time, it made me happy.

09:59.610 --> 10:03.650
You taught me that the potential of Pokémon is still endless.

10:04.870 --> 10:06.600
I want to possess that power as well.

10:18.200 --> 10:22.290
This light is energy so powerful that it can control Zygarde.

10:22.960 --> 10:23.590
Satoshi-kun...

10:23.940 --> 10:24.950
...and Gekkouga.

10:25.740 --> 10:28.900
I will take control of your bond phenomenon.

10:29.630 --> 10:30.400
What?!

10:31.230 --> 10:32.250
That way, you two...

10:33.190 --> 10:34.920
...will be mine as well.

10:47.350 --> 10:48.240
Please stop, Director!

10:54.310 --> 10:55.090
We...

10:55.520 --> 10:57.790
...won't be under your thumb!

10:58.700 --> 11:00.190
Do you still not get it?

11:01.330 --> 11:03.150
When the world that currently exists breaks down,

11:04.810 --> 11:08.220
you two will become the guides of the chosen ones!

11:08.950 --> 11:10.820
Never!

11:11.320 --> 11:12.670
We're us!

11:13.310 --> 11:13.580
Alan!

11:14.310 --> 11:16.290
I don't know what happened to you,

11:16.770 --> 11:18.390
but you can't be looking down forever!

11:19.010 --> 11:20.580
What happened in the past doesn't matter!

11:21.150 --> 11:21.700
I trust...

11:22.130 --> 11:23.870
...the Alan I know!

11:25.640 --> 11:27.380
I love this world!

11:27.970 --> 11:29.160
There are people I love here,

11:29.580 --> 11:30.810
as well as Pokémon I love.

11:31.320 --> 11:33.000
I won't let you destroy it, no matter what!

11:39.030 --> 11:40.380
Fight me, Fleur-de-lis!

11:49.530 --> 11:50.970
Pokémon Quiz.

11:51.360 --> 11:53.190
The answer is...

11:54.050 --> 12:03.980
Coming up next:

11:54.050 --> 11:59.020
Here comes Satoshi Gekkouga!

11:55.040 --> 11:59.820
Pocket Monsters XY&Z is brought to you by these sponsors.

11:59.060 --> 12:03.980
Stop Fleur-de-lis' ambitions!

12:38.470 --> 12:38.900
Satoshi,

12:39.430 --> 12:39.950
are you all right?

12:40.630 --> 12:41.350
Alan...

12:43.030 --> 12:44.260
Truly excellent.

12:45.020 --> 12:47.270
So not even Mega Evolution energy works.

12:48.850 --> 12:49.720
Thank you, Satoshi.

12:50.640 --> 12:51.670
You opened my eyes.

12:52.280 --> 12:52.650
Alan!

12:53.640 --> 12:54.670
Please help me out.

12:55.620 --> 12:56.370
I'll stop the director.

12:57.040 --> 12:58.170
That's the spirit.

13:00.070 --> 13:00.480
Come out,

13:00.850 --> 13:01.520
Lizardon!

13:03.540 --> 13:05.720
Use Dragon Claw to free Pikachu and the others!

13:11.520 --> 13:12.490
Let's go, everyone!

13:15.460 --> 13:17.470
Are you trying to defeat me?

13:18.660 --> 13:19.130
Director,

13:20.140 --> 13:23.320
I will prove to you what "being the strongest in order to protect someone" means...

13:24.090 --> 13:24.600
...by defeating you!

13:26.530 --> 13:28.060
It's such a shame, Alan.

13:28.960 --> 13:32.280
I don't need you guys for the world I will build.

13:32.780 --> 13:34.260
I won't let you decide...

13:34.620 --> 13:36.070
...who's needed and who isn't!

13:36.860 --> 13:37.820
I have no choice.

13:46.360 --> 13:47.630
I will eliminate you all...

13:52.140 --> 13:54.190
...with my own hands.

13:59.250 --> 14:01.000
Lepardas, Shadow Claw!

14:01.310 --> 14:03.180
Crimgan, Dragon Claw!

14:07.230 --> 14:08.440
Elezard, Flash!

14:10.760 --> 14:12.390
Rentorar, Wild Charge!

14:15.470 --> 14:16.720
Harimaron, Pin Missile!

14:16.930 --> 14:18.180
Horubee, Mud Shot!

14:23.580 --> 14:24.110
Crimgan!

14:24.310 --> 14:24.830
Lepardas!

14:27.490 --> 14:28.070
Return!

14:31.520 --> 14:32.790
H-Hey!

14:32.790 --> 14:34.010
Let go!

14:34.900 --> 14:36.090
Capture complete.

14:36.770 --> 14:38.010
I expected nothing less, Citroid!

14:38.500 --> 14:39.790
This is your fault.

14:39.790 --> 14:40.850
It's <i>your</i> fault!

14:47.410 --> 14:48.060
Squishy...

15:15.310 --> 15:15.980
Young lady,

15:16.740 --> 15:17.920
why did you come here by yourself?

15:20.540 --> 15:21.320
Squishy is...

15:22.360 --> 15:23.220
...gonna lose...

15:31.480 --> 15:32.650
Pull yourself together, Eureka!

15:33.680 --> 15:34.390
Squishy...

15:34.870 --> 15:35.690
What happened?

15:41.680 --> 15:43.250
It's a  success.

15:43.910 --> 15:48.450
Fleur-de-lis-sama, we are now in control of the other Zygarde as well.

15:48.960 --> 15:49.670
Of Squishy?

15:53.030 --> 15:55.500
Now world peace will spread faster.

15:56.790 --> 15:57.960
You keep talking about "peace"...

15:58.300 --> 15:59.680
What part of this is "peace"?

16:00.320 --> 16:02.700
What do you know?

16:03.590 --> 16:06.430
You don't know the horrible parts of the world.

16:13.320 --> 16:14.450
In the past,

16:15.510 --> 16:19.780
there was a time when I, too, extended a helping hand to suffering people.

16:22.050 --> 16:23.700
The people were happy.

16:24.470 --> 16:25.940
But that was just the beginning.

16:27.220 --> 16:31.480
They took the help for granted and made nothing but demands.

16:33.610 --> 16:36.430
They started loudly asserting their rights.

16:36.880 --> 16:39.620
Our helping hand had made them arrogant.

16:44.360 --> 16:45.870
Humans are foolish.

16:47.090 --> 16:51.280
This system we call the world eventually ends up with a broken cogwheel somewhere.

16:53.130 --> 16:54.930
That's why I'm planning to destroy...

16:56.030 --> 16:57.840
...and modify it.

16:59.690 --> 17:00.990
It's a reset...

17:01.640 --> 17:03.860
...for the sake of creating my utopia.

17:04.970 --> 17:07.910
You won't live to see tomorrow!

17:13.430 --> 17:14.620
A Gyarados and a Kaenjishi...

17:17.060 --> 17:17.990
Gyarados,

17:18.340 --> 17:20.410
unleash the power of Mega Evolution!

17:32.750 --> 17:33.190
Let's go,

17:33.550 --> 17:34.090
Lizardon!

17:34.770 --> 17:35.930
Surpass evolution!

17:36.700 --> 17:37.790
Mega evolve!

17:51.630 --> 17:52.680
Let's go, everyone!

17:58.200 --> 17:58.540
Over there!

18:05.590 --> 18:06.880
Oh, so you're back.

18:07.520 --> 18:08.330
How's Miare looking?

18:09.070 --> 18:10.140
It's a festival of plants.

18:10.760 --> 18:12.230
Too bad you had to stay here.

18:12.740 --> 18:13.340
Momiji-sama.

18:14.990 --> 18:17.350
A press helicopter is heading this way.

18:18.270 --> 18:19.100
A press helicopter?

18:19.490 --> 18:20.690
You know what to do, right?

18:20.690 --> 18:22.610
Show the guests around politely.

18:28.590 --> 18:31.110
As I thought, the lock code has been overwritten.

18:31.790 --> 18:33.330
Please leave it to me!

18:36.760 --> 18:39.040
Analyzing... Analyzing...

18:48.380 --> 18:51.090
Kaenjishi, Gyarados, Incinerate!

18:52.730 --> 18:54.430
Pikachu, Thunderbolt!

18:54.430 --> 18:55.800
Numelgon, Dragon Pulse!

19:03.390 --> 19:04.250
Gekkouga,

19:04.250 --> 19:05.120
Cut!

19:06.710 --> 19:08.730
Kaenjishi, Hyper Beam!

19:10.310 --> 19:11.370
Onvern, Boomburst!

19:17.000 --> 19:17.540
Lizardon,

19:17.980 --> 19:18.950
Dragon Claw!

19:22.440 --> 19:23.250
Gyarados,

19:23.250 --> 19:24.330
use Stone Edge!

19:28.630 --> 19:30.380
Onvern, Dragon Claw!

19:30.380 --> 19:32.260
Luchabull, Karate Chop!

19:32.550 --> 19:33.340
Kaenjishi,

19:33.640 --> 19:34.540
Fire Fang!

19:40.380 --> 19:41.920
Pikachu, Thunderbolt!

19:56.000 --> 20:00.410
In this crisis, everyone is fighting by doing what they do best.

20:02.870 --> 20:05.950
What will be the fate of Satoshi and Alan, who're fighting Fleur-de-lis?

20:07.370 --> 20:08.920
We will defeat you.

20:09.400 --> 20:10.560
And we will save Squishy!

20:11.060 --> 20:13.390
We won't let you do as you please and destroy our world!

20:16.980 --> 20:21.960
The biggest incident in the history of Kalos develops into an even bigger crisis.

20:31.110 --> 20:31.670
Ladies and gentlemen,

20:32.250 --> 20:34.750
this time I will talk about Operation Z,

20:35.280 --> 20:37.300
our sublime plan.

20:38.530 --> 20:41.850
The power generated during Mega Evolution is extraordinarily huge.

20:42.380 --> 20:50.310
By collecting and researching Mega Evolution energy, we were finally able to control the legendary Pokémon Zygarde.

20:50.760 --> 20:54.910
Zygarde's power is so incredible it even exceeded our expectations!

20:55.350 --> 20:57.840
Zygarde is the Pokémon that protects order in Kalos.

20:58.190 --> 21:06.190
By controlling it, we use the power originally intended for protecting nature for the purpose of destruction, delivering judgment on this dirty world.

21:06.810 --> 21:11.620
And that is Operation Z, the Flare Gang's sublime plan.

21:11.620 --> 21:15.900
If this plan succeeds, we can create the wonderful world without conflict that we've been wanting!

21:15.900 --> 21:17.970
Those who sympathize with the Flare Gang's ideals,

21:17.970 --> 21:20.490
we're waiting for you to join!

21:21.060 --> 21:26.060
Sunday September 4th at 8am!

21:22.080 --> 21:24.500
A festival of men at Pokénchi!

21:22.240 --> 21:23.520
No matter what you say

21:24.100 --> 21:25.610
Yeah, Opapea!

21:28.320 --> 21:30.200
All right, everyone! Let's go together!

21:30.410 --> 21:31.510
Towards our next adventure!

21:32.660 --> 21:34.000
I will protect Squishy!

21:34.430 --> 21:36.150
I promised to protect it, after all!

21:36.510 --> 21:37.380
Citroid...

21:37.690 --> 21:39.000
I am glad to have met you.

21:39.650 --> 21:39.920
Yes,

21:40.400 --> 21:41.810
I was happy too.

21:42.460 --> 21:43.220
Let's go!

21:43.690 --> 21:44.440
Yeah!

21:44.900 --> 21:48.010
Next time on Pocket Monsters XY&Z:

21:48.660 --> 21:50.190
Attack on Miare Gym!

21:50.450 --> 21:51.780
The Citroid Forever!!

21:52.500 --> 21:54.580
Everyone, get Pokémon!

21:52.570 --> 21:56.050
Next Time

21:52.570 --> 21:56.050
Attack on Miare Gym!
The Citroid Forever!!

21:56.080 --> 22:06.110
Next episode:

21:56.080 --> 22:01.040
A struggle at the Miare Gym!

21:56.940 --> 22:01.540
Pocket Monsters XY&Z was brought to you by these sponsors.

22:01.070 --> 22:06.110
What will happen to the Citroid...?
